menu "ESP FireVAD Configuration"

    config FIREVAD_ENABLE_PERFORMANCE_LOGS
        bool "Enable per-frame performance logging"
        default n
        help
            Enable detailed logging of Dense and FSMN layer execution times.
            
            WARNING: This logs every 10ms frame (~100 logs/second) which can:
            - Cause UART TX buffer overflow
            - Trigger task watchdog timeout
            - Significantly impact system performance
            
            Only enable for performance debugging and disable for production use.
            
            Recommended: Keep DISABLED unless actively debugging performance.

endmenu
